---
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Lamina POP — Investor Deck</title>
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@500;600;700&display=swap" />
</head>
<body>

  <div id="progress-bar"></div>

  <nav class="nav-dots" id="navdots" aria-label="Slide navigation">
    <a href="#s1" title="The Thesis"></a>
    <a href="#s2" title="The Problem"></a>
    <a href="#s3" title="Technology"></a>
    <a href="#s4" title="Speed & Scale"></a>
    <a href="#s5" title="Human Impact"></a>
    <a href="#s6" title="Traction"></a>
    <a href="#s7" title="Business Model"></a>
    <a href="#s8" title="The Ask"></a>
    <a href="#s9" title="Contact"></a>
  </nav>

  <!-- ── S1: The Thesis ── -->
  <section class="slide s-pop" id="s1">
    <div class="inner s1-grid">
      <div>
        <h1 class="s1-title" data-a>LAMINA<br>POP</h1>
      </div>
      <div class="s1-right">
        <p class="eyebrow" data-a style="--d:0.15s">01 — The Thesis</p>
        <p class="s1-tagline" data-a style="--d:0.3s">Redefining Structural Infrastructure<br>for Emerging Markets.</p>
        <p class="s1-meta" data-a style="--d:0.45s">Investor Deck · 2026</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <span class="slide-num">01 / 09</span>
  </section>

  <!-- ── S2: The Core Problem ── -->
  <section class="slide s-dark" id="s2">
    <div class="inner">
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-light" data-a>02 — The Core Problem</p>
      <h2 data-a style="--d:0.12s">The Shelter<br>and Debt Trap</h2>
      <p class="lead lead-muted" data-a style="--d:0.24s">In emerging markets, families are forced to choose between two unsustainable paths:</p>
      <div class="two-col" data-a style="--d:0.38s">
        <div class="prob-card">
          <div class="prob-num">01</div>
          <h3 class="prob-title">Hazardous Shelter</h3>
          <p>Living in substandard dirt-floor structures that cause chronic illness and trap families in cycles of poor health.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="prob-card">
          <div class="prob-num">02</div>
          <h3 class="prob-title">Debt Trap</h3>
          <p>Taking on exploitative microfinance loans with crushing 30%+ compounding interest to build traditional concrete masonry.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── S3: Technology Solution ── -->
  <section class="slide s-paper" id="s3">
    <div class="inner">
      <p class="eyebrow" data-a>03 — The Technology Solution</p>
      <h2 data-a style="--d:0.12s">Waveform<br>Geometry</h2>
      <div class="tech-grid">
        <div class="tech-left">
          <p class="lead" data-a style="--d:0.22s">A patented architectural technology that turns lightweight, globally accessible sheet metal into strong, load-bearing structures.</p>
          <ul class="feat-list" data-a style="--d:0.34s">
            <li>
              <span class="feat-title">3-in-1 Envelope</span>
              <span class="feat-desc">Parallel galvanized steel sheets are vertically riveted to serve as wall, roof, and frame simultaneously.</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="feat-title">Zero Lumber or Masonry</span>
              <span class="feat-desc">Eliminates the need for traditional structural wood or concrete block infrastructure.</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="feat-title">Built for Extremes</span>
              <span class="feat-desc">Seismically flexible and wind-resistant. Standing for over 15 years in tropical, earthquake-prone regions with zero structural failures.</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div data-a style="--d:0.46s">
          <img src="/deck/laminas.png" alt="Lamina POP waveform steel sheets" class="tech-img" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── S4: Speed and Scale ── -->
  <section class="slide s-img" id="s4">
    <img src="/deck/speed.jpg" alt="Lamina POP construction team" class="slide-bg" />
    <div class="slide-overlay"></div>
    <div class="inner">
      <p class="eyebrow" data-a>04 — Speed and Scale</p>
      <h2 data-a style="--d:0.12s">7 to 14<br>Days</h2>
      <p class="lead" data-a style="--d:0.22s">The time it takes a 3-person team using basic hand tools to assemble a complete, flat-packed Lamina POP home.</p>
      <div class="speed-row" data-a style="--d:0.34s">
        <div class="speed-stat">
          <div class="speed-label">Logistics</div>
          <div class="speed-val">Resilient</div>
          <p>Flat-pack shipping for remote, low-infrastructure areas where concrete trucks cannot pass.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="speed-stat">
          <div class="speed-label">Cost Per Unit</div>
          <div class="speed-val">$4,200–<br>$5,000</div>
          <p>Roughly half the price of regional masonry alternatives.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── S5: Human Impact ── -->
  <section class="slide s-img" id="s5">
    <img src="/deck/impact.jpg" alt="Lamina POP family home" class="slide-bg" />
    <div class="slide-overlay s5-overlay"></div>
    <div class="inner">
      <p class="eyebrow" data-a>05 — The Human Impact</p>
      <h2 data-a style="--d:0.12s">The Structural<br>Surplus</h2>
      <p class="lead" data-a style="--d:0.22s">Moving a family out of substandard shelter into a Lamina POP home immediately transforms their household economics:</p>
      <div class="impact-row" data-a style="--d:0.34s">
        <div class="impact-stat">
          <div class="impact-val">−44%</div>
          <div class="impact-desc">Reduction in school and work absenteeism</div>
        </div>
        <div class="impact-divider"></div>
        <div class="impact-stat">
          <div class="impact-val">+17%</div>
          <div class="impact-desc">Structural increase in available household financial capital by permanently cutting emergency medical expenses</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── S6: Market Traction ── -->
  <section class="slide s-img" id="s6">
    <img src="/deck/traction.jpg" alt="Lamina POP project community" class="slide-bg" />
    <div class="slide-overlay"></div>
    <div class="inner">
      <p class="eyebrow" data-a>06 — Market Traction</p>
      <h2 data-a style="--d:0.12s">Proven<br>Validation</h2>
      <div class="traction-grid" data-a style="--d:0.26s">
        <div class="traction-card">
          <div class="traction-val">15+</div>
          <div class="traction-key">Permanent Structures Built</div>
          <p>Homes, warehouses, and institutional schools standing across Central America.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="traction-card">
          <div class="traction-val">$75K</div>
          <div class="traction-key">LTM Revenue</div>
          <p>Achieved during our lean, capital-efficient, high-margin pilot R&D phase.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="traction-card">
          <div class="traction-val">✓</div>
          <div class="traction-key">Habitat for Humanity</div>
          <p>Active deployment pipelines in partnership with one of the world's leading housing NGOs.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="traction-card">
          <div class="traction-val">3×</div>
          <div class="traction-key">Global Recognition</div>
          <p>Backed by SantanderX, the Autodesk Foundation, and incubated at Cambridge Judge Business School.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── S7: Commercial Engine ── -->
  <section class="slide s-dark" id="s7">
    <div class="inner">
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-light" data-a>07 — The Commercial Engine</p>
      <h2 data-a style="--d:0.12s">The Hybrid<br>Business Model</h2>
      <p class="lead lead-muted" data-a style="--d:0.22s">We balance three distinct customer streams to maintain a self-sustaining enterprise:</p>
      <div class="model-grid" data-a style="--d:0.36s">
        <div class="model-card">
          <div class="model-tag">B2B Commercial</div>
          <p>High-design cabins and utility structures for eco-resorts and industrial clients at full market rate, generating a ~20% margin.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="model-card">
          <div class="model-tag">Mid-Market Direct</div>
          <p>Affordable housing solutions for private lower-middle-income buyers seeking an accessible path to dignified shelter.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="model-card">
          <div class="model-tag">Institutional Tenders</div>
          <p>Bulk, high-volume social housing infrastructure alongside corporate CSR programs and municipal budgets.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── S8: The Ask ── -->
  <section class="slide s-pop" id="s8">
    <div class="inner">
      <p class="eyebrow" data-a>08 — The Ask & Use of Funds</p>
      <h2 class="ink" data-a style="--d:0.12s">Scaling<br>Manufacturing</h2>
      <p class="lead ink-muted" data-a style="--d:0.22s">We are raising strategic capital to transition from our proven pilot phase into a centralized prefabrication facility.</p>
      <div class="ask-grid" data-a style="--d:0.36s">
        <div class="ask-card">
          <div class="ask-pct">40%</div>
          <div class="ask-label">Factory Optimization</div>
          <p>Upgrading tooling to cut on-site assembly time from 14 days down to 7 days.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ask-card">
          <div class="ask-pct">30%</div>
          <div class="ask-label">Direct Bulk Procurement</div>
          <p>Securing steel directly from mills to reduce per-unit costs by 12–18%.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ask-card">
          <div class="ask-pct">20%</div>
          <div class="ask-label">Key Operational Team</div>
          <p>Expanding full-time local management, data governance, and manufacturing logistics staff.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ask-card">
          <div class="ask-pct">10%</div>
          <div class="ask-label">Institutional Certifications</div>
          <p>Finalizing approved status with national public housing subsidy frameworks.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── S9: Contact ── -->
  <section class="slide s-dark" id="s9">
    <div class="inner">
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-light" data-a>09 — Contact</p>
      <h2 class="closing-h2" data-a style="--d:0.12s">Build the Future<br>With <em class="pop-em">Us.</em></h2>
      <p class="calc-callout" data-a style="--d:0.22s">Try our free <a href="https://www.laminapop.com/calculator" class="calc-link">construction cost calculator</a> — designed to put the system in anyone's hands, anywhere in the world.</p>
      <div class="contact-block" data-a style="--d:0.38s">
        <div class="contact-row">
          <span class="c-label">CEO</span>
          <span class="c-val">Sebastian Swezey</span>
        </div>
        <div class="contact-row">
          <span class="c-label">Email</span>
          <a href="mailto:swezey47@gmail.com" class="c-link">swezey47@gmail.com</a>
        </div>
        <div class="contact-row">
          <span class="c-label">Web</span>
          <a href="https://www.laminapop.com" class="c-link">www.laminapop.com</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="c-copy" data-a style="--d:0.5s">© 2004–2026 Lamina POP</p>
    </div>
  </section>

</body>
</html>

<style is:global>
  *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

  :root {
    --ink:   #0A0A0A;
    --paper: #FFFFFF;
    --pop:   #FFD600;
    --muted: #6B6B6B;
    --line:  #E5E5E5;
  }

  html {
    scroll-behavior: smooth;
    scroll-snap-type: y mandatory;
    overflow-y: scroll;
    height: 100%;
  }

  body {
    font-family: Inter, sans-serif;
    background: var(--ink);
    color: var(--ink);
    line-height: 1.55;
    height: 100%;
  }

  /* ── progress bar ── */
  #progress-bar {
    position: fixed;
    top: 0; left: 0;
    height: 3px;
    background: var(--pop);
    width: 0;
    transition: width 0.5s ease;
    z-index: 200;
  }

  /* ── nav dots ── */
  .nav-dots {
    position: fixed;
    right: 1.5rem;
    top: 50%;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.65rem;
    z-index: 100;
  }
  .nav-dots a {
    width: 7px;
    height: 7px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgba(0,0,0,0.22);
    display: block;
    transition: background 0.25s, transform 0.25s;
  }
  .nav-dots a.active,
  .nav-dots a:hover {
    background: var(--ink);
    transform: scale(1.6);
  }
  .nav-dots.on-dark a { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.28); }
  .nav-dots.on-dark a.active,
  .nav-dots.on-dark a:hover {
    background: var(--pop);
    transform: scale(1.6);
  }

  /* ── slide base ── */
  .slide {
    scroll-snap-align: start;
    min-height: 100svh;
    width: 100%;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 5rem 2rem;
    position: relative;
  }
  .s-pop   { background: var(--pop); }
  .s-dark  { background: var(--ink); color: var(--paper); }
  .s-paper { background: var(--paper); }

  .inner {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  /* ── type ── */
  .eyebrow {
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .eyebrow-light { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.38); }

  h2 {
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 5rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 0.95;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    color: inherit;
  }
  .s-dark h2 { color: var(--paper); }

  .lead {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    max-width: 640px;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }
  .lead-muted { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.48); }
  .ink-muted  { color: rgba(10,10,10,0.5); }
  .ink        { color: var(--ink); }

  /* ── entrance animations ── */
  [data-a] {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(26px);
    transition: opacity 0.65s ease, transform 0.65s ease;
    transition-delay: var(--d, 0s);
  }
  .is-visible [data-a] {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translateY(0);
  }

  /* ── S1: Cover ── */
  .s1-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 4rem;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .s1-title {
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(5rem, 12vw, 10rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 0.86;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .s1-right {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2rem;
  }
  .s1-tagline {
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 2.5vw, 2rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--ink);
    line-height: 1.2;
  }
  .s1-meta {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: rgba(0,0,0,0.45);
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .slide-num {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 2rem;
    right: 2.5rem;
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
  }

  /* ── S2: Problem ── */
  .two-col {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }
  .prob-card {
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    padding: 2.5rem;
  }
  .prob-num {
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    color: var(--pop);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }
  .prob-title {
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.375rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--paper);
    margin-bottom: 0.875rem;
  }
  .prob-card p {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.52);
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  /* ── image-background slides ── */
  .s-img {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    color: var(--paper);
  }
  .slide-bg {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center;
    z-index: 0;
  }
  .slide-overlay {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(160deg, rgba(10,10,10,0.88) 0%, rgba(10,10,10,0.6) 100%);
    z-index: 1;
  }
  .s5-overlay {
    background: linear-gradient(160deg, rgba(10,10,10,0.9) 0%, rgba(180,100,0,0.45) 100%);
  }
  .s-img .inner { position: relative; z-index: 2; }
  .s-img .eyebrow { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4); }
  .s-img h2 { color: var(--paper); }
  .s-img .lead { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.62); }
  .s-img .feat-list li { border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.12); }
  .s-img .feat-title { color: var(--paper); }
  .s-img .feat-desc { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.55); }
  .s-img .speed-stat { border-top-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.14); }
  .s-img .speed-val { color: var(--paper); }
  .s-img .speed-stat p { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5); }
  .s-img .impact-val { color: var(--pop); }
  .s-img .impact-desc { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.62); }
  .s-img .impact-divider { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.15); }
  .s-img .traction-grid { border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.12); }
  .s-img .traction-card { border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.12); }
  .s-img .traction-val { color: var(--pop); }
  .s-img .traction-key { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4); }
  .s-img .traction-card p { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.55); }

  /* ── S3: Technology ── */
  .tech-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 4rem;
    align-items: start;
  }
  .tech-left { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
  .feat-list {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }
  .feat-list li {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding: 1.5rem 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }
  .feat-list li:last-child { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .feat-title {
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .feat-desc {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .s4-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 4rem;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .s4-left { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
  .s4-right {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .speed-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
    border-radius: 2px;
  }

  /* ── S4: Speed ── */
  .speed-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  .speed-stat {
    border-top: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.14);
    padding-top: 1.75rem;
  }
  .speed-label {
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--pop);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  .speed-val {
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3.5vw, 2.75rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--paper);
    line-height: 1.05;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .speed-stat p {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.48);
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .s5-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 4rem;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .s5-left { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
  .s5-right {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .impact-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
    border-radius: 2px;
  }

  /* ── S5: Impact ── */
  .impact-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr;
    gap: 3rem;
    align-items: start;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }
  .impact-divider {
    width: 1px;
    background: rgba(0,0,0,0.18);
    align-self: stretch;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }
  .impact-val {
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5.5rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--ink);
    line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .impact-desc {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: rgba(0,0,0,0.52);
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .s6-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 4rem;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .s6-left { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
  .s6-right {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .traction-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
    border-radius: 2px;
